# Raspberry Pi may consume telemetry and publish retained sensor settings.
user avora-pi
topic read avora/sensors/+
topic read avora/status/#
topic read avora/seedling/+/telemetry
topic read avora/seedling/+/status
topic write avora/config/esp32/sensors/#
topic write avora/config/esp32/calibration/#

# ESP32/ESP8266 nodes may publish telemetry and read only their settings.
user avora-sensors
topic write avora/sensors/+
topic write avora/status/esp32/ads1115
topic write avora/seedling/+/telemetry
topic write avora/seedling/+/status
topic read avora/config/esp32/sensors/#
topic read avora/config/esp32/calibration/#

